                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yoshua ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Boolela babaandu ba Isiraeli oli, ‘robora chingoba che khumulilamo nga ne namuboolela enywe khubirira khu Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naloma ndi omundu owiira okundi ne akhang'aliilemo tawe anyala elukhilayo. Chingoba echo chikhabe chichenywe khumulilamo khukhwilukha oyo owenya khumwiyacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyala elukhila mu lulala lwe chingoba mala eema mu silibwa sie lukoba, eloocha kamwikholeekhekho khu basaakhulu be lukoba. Nio basaakhulu abo bamubukule bamuyile mu lukoba, bamue abuundu mala asikale ebweeneyo ne nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu owe khukhwiyacha sifuki ne amutimakho, se bakhoya bamwakaanisia omwiiri tawe. Sikila eera owasie ne akhang'aliilemo tawe, ne se aabakho ne busiku ne naye tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne akhoya arama mu lukoba omwo khukhwola nga ne aliima ebweeni we kumuse khulwe khukhalakilwa ne lundi khukhwola khu lifwa lio Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali owe siise esio ne lilioola. Nio omwiiri oyo anyala akobola engo mu lukoba lwewe ne mungo mwewe, nilwo elukhamo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, Baisiraeli barobora Kadeshi mu Kalilaya, mumbo mwa Yoritani, mu sibala sie bikulu sia Nafutali, Shekemu, mu sibala sie sikulu sia Efuraimu, ne Heburoni, mu sibala sie sikulu sia Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elubeka lwe bukwe owa Yoritani, mu siangalaamwe sisieteleela ebukwe owa Yeriko, barobora Beseri mu sibala sia Rubeni, Ramoti mu Kileati, mu sibala sia Kati, ne Kolani mu Bashani, mu sibala sia Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chino chaba chingoba che khumulilamo chicharoborwa khulwe babaandu ba Isiraeli boosi ne baakwa ba baamenyamo. Yesi yesi owiira omundu ne akhang'aliilemo tawe anyala amulilayo khukhwama khu mundu oenja khumwiyacha. Nono yaba se anyala erwa ne akhamalile khukhwiima ebweeni we kumuse tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
